{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25964","headline":"白露 · 鲍溶","name":"白露","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"清蝉暂休响，丰露还移色。\n金飙爽晨华，玉壶增夜刻。\n已低疎萤焰，稍减哀蝉力。\n迎社促燕心，助风劳鴈翼。\n一悲纨扇情，再想清浅忆。\n高高拜月归，轧轧挑灯织。\n盈盈玉盘泪，何处无消息。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"鲍溶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25964.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25964","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}